---
import Figure from '../Figure.astro';
import { polyline } from '../geometry';
import { pageLang } from '../../../utils/lang';

const ru = pageLang(Astro.url) === 'ru';

// A 2×2 weight matrix and its SVD in closed form.
// WᵀW = [[a, b], [b, c]]; its eigenvalues are σ₁², σ₂² and its eigenvectors are v₁, v₂.
const W = [[1.3, 0.7], [0.3, 0.9]];
const a = W[0][0] ** 2 + W[1][0] ** 2;
const c = W[0][1] ** 2 + W[1][1] ** 2;
const b = W[0][0] * W[0][1] + W[1][0] * W[1][1];
const mid = (a + c) / 2;
const rad = Math.hypot((a - c) / 2, b);
const s1 = Math.sqrt(mid + rad); // σ_max ≈ 1.657
const s2 = Math.sqrt(mid - rad); // σ_min ≈ 0.580
const phi = 0.5 * Math.atan2(2 * b, a - c); // angle of v₁
const v1 = [Math.cos(phi), Math.sin(phi)];
const v2 = [-Math.sin(phi), Math.cos(phi)];
const mul = (m: number[][], v: number[]) => [m[0][0] * v[0] + m[0][1] * v[1], m[1][0] * v[0] + m[1][1] * v[1]];
const Wv1 = mul(W, v1); // = σ₁ u₁
const Wv2 = mul(W, v2); // = σ₂ u₂
const u1 = [Wv1[0] / s1, Wv1[1] / s1];

const U = 50; // pixels per unit
const PW = 190; // panel width
const CX = PW / 2;
const CY = 150;
const R = 90; // half-length of the grid cross
const ellipse = (m: number[][]) =>
  polyline(
    Array.from({ length: 145 }, (_, i) => {
      const t = (2 * Math.PI * i) / 144;
      const p = mul(m, [Math.cos(t), Math.sin(t)]);
      return [CX + U * p[0], CY - U * p[1]] as const;
    }),
  ) + ' Z';
const I = [[1, 0], [0, 1]];
const Wn = W.map((row) => row.map((x) => x / s1));
const unitPath = ellipse(I);
const wPath = ellipse(W);
const wnPath = ellipse(Wn);
const px = (v: number[], k = 1) => CX + U * v[0] * k;
const py = (v: number[], k = 1) => CY - U * v[1] * k;

const f2 = (x: number) => x.toFixed(2);
const GAP = 52;
const NX = 40; // horizontal offset of the panels in the narrow variant
const variants = [
  { cls: 'fig-wide fig-bp-640', sfx: 'w', vb: `0 0 ${3 * PW + 2 * GAP} 300`, o: [[0, 0], [PW + GAP, 0], [2 * (PW + GAP), 0]], narrow: false },
  { cls: 'fig-narrow fig-bp-640', sfx: 'n', vb: `0 0 380 990`, o: [[NX, 0], [NX, 300], [NX, 690]], narrow: true },
];
const id = 'wgan-spectral-norm';
---

<Figure
  id={id}
  title={ru ? "Матрица растягивает единичную окружность в эллипс; её наибольшее сингулярное число — самая длинная полуось" : "A matrix stretches the unit circle into an ellipse; its largest singular value is the longest semi-axis"}
  caption={ru ? `W = [[1.3, 0.7], [0.3, 0.9]]. Её правые сингулярные векторы v₁, v₂ переходят в σ₁u₁ и σ₂u₂ — полуоси образа единичной окружности под действием W: σ₁ = ${f2(s1)} и σ₂ = ${f2(s2)} (их произведение ${f2(s1 * s2)} равно |det W|). Спектральная нормализация делит на наибольшее сингулярное число σ₁, поэтому у эллипса для Ŵ = W/σ₁ полуоси равны 1 и ${f2(s2 / s1)}: он касается единичной окружности в точках ±u₁ и лежит внутри неё, так что ‖Ŵh‖₂ ≤ ‖h‖₂ для любого h.` : `W = [[1.3, 0.7], [0.3, 0.9]]. Its right singular vectors v₁, v₂ are mapped to σ₁u₁ and σ₂u₂, the semi-axes of the image of the unit circle under W: σ₁ = ${f2(s1)} and σ₂ = ${f2(s2)} (their product ${f2(s1 * s2)} equals |det W|). Spectral normalization divides by the largest singular value σ₁, so the ellipse of Ŵ = W/σ₁ has semi-axes 1 and ${f2(s2 / s1)}: it touches the unit circle at ±u₁ and lies inside it, so ‖Ŵh‖₂ ≤ ‖h‖₂ for every h.`}
>
  {variants.map((v) => (
    <svg class={v.cls} viewBox={v.vb} role="img" aria-labelledby={`${id}-${v.sfx}-t ${id}-${v.sfx}-d`}>
      <title id={`${id}-${v.sfx}-t`}>{ru ? "Спектральная нормализация матрицы 2 на 2" : "Spectral normalization of a 2 by 2 matrix"}</title>
      <desc id={`${id}-${v.sfx}-d`}>{ru ? "Три панели. Первая: единичная окружность с двумя перпендикулярными единичными векторами v1 и v2. Вторая: после умножения на W окружность превращается в наклонный эллипс; его большая полуось сигма 1 на u1 имеет длину 1.66, а малая полуось сигма 2 на u2 — длину 0.58; для сравнения показана штриховая единичная окружность. Третья: после деления W на сигма max эллипс имеет полуоси 1 и 0.35 и помещается внутри штриховой единичной окружности, касаясь её в точках плюс и минус u1." : "Three panels. First: the unit circle with two perpendicular unit vectors v1 and v2. Second: after multiplying by W the circle becomes a tilted ellipse; its long semi-axis sigma 1 times u1 has length 1.66 and its short semi-axis sigma 2 times u2 has length 0.58; the dashed unit circle is shown for reference. Third: after dividing W by sigma max the ellipse has semi-axes 1 and 0.35 and fits inside the dashed unit circle, touching it at plus and minus u1."}</desc>
      <defs>
        <marker id={`${id}-${v.sfx}-amber`} viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8.5" refY="5" markerWidth="9" markerHeight="9" markerUnits="userSpaceOnUse" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M 0 0.8 L 9.5 5 L 0 9.2 L 2.6 5 Z" fill="var(--fig-amber)" />
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <g transform={`translate(${v.o[0][0]} ${v.o[0][1]})`}>
        <text class="f-title" x={CX} y="24" text-anchor="middle">{ru ? "окружность ‖h‖₂ = 1" : "unit circle ‖h‖₂ = 1"}</text>
        <line class="f-grid" x1={CX - R} x2={CX + R} y1={CY} y2={CY} />
        <line class="f-grid" x1={CX} x2={CX} y1={CY - R} y2={CY + R} />
        <path class="f-line" d={unitPath} />
        <line class="f-line f-amber f-bold" x1={CX} y1={CY} x2={px(v1)} y2={py(v1)} marker-end={`url(#${id}-${v.sfx}-amber)`} />
        <line class="f-line f-green f-bold" x1={CX} y1={CY} x2={px(v2)} y2={py(v2)} marker-end="url(#f-arrow-green)" />
        <text class="f-math f-t-amber f-halo" x={px(v1, 1.32)} y={py(v1, 1.32) + 6} text-anchor="middle">v<tspan dy="5" font-size="13">1</tspan></text>
        <text class="f-math f-t-green f-halo" x={px(v2, 1.34)} y={py(v2, 1.34) + 6} text-anchor="middle">v<tspan dy="5" font-size="13">2</tspan></text>
      </g>

      <g transform={`translate(${v.o[1][0]} ${v.o[1][1]})`}>
        <text class="f-title" x={CX} y="24" text-anchor="middle">{ru ? "после W: растяжение" : "after W: stretched"}</text>
        <line class="f-grid" x1={CX - R} x2={CX + R} y1={CY} y2={CY} />
        <line class="f-grid" x1={CX} x2={CX} y1={CY - R} y2={CY + R} />
        <path class="f-thin f-muted f-dash" d={unitPath} />
        <path class="f-fill-blue" d={wPath} />
        <path class="f-line f-blue" d={wPath} />
        <line class="f-line f-amber f-bold" x1={CX} y1={CY} x2={px(Wv1)} y2={py(Wv1)} marker-end={`url(#${id}-${v.sfx}-amber)`} />
        <line class="f-line f-green f-bold" x1={CX} y1={CY} x2={px(Wv2)} y2={py(Wv2)} marker-end="url(#f-arrow-green)" />
        <text class="f-math f-t-amber f-halo" x={px(Wv1) + 2} y={py(Wv1) - 10} text-anchor="middle">σ<tspan dy="5" font-size="13">1</tspan><tspan dy="-5">u</tspan><tspan dy="5" font-size="13">1</tspan></text>
        <text class="f-math f-t-green f-halo" x={px(Wv2, 2.05)} y={py(Wv2, 2.05) + 2} text-anchor="middle">σ<tspan dy="5" font-size="13">2</tspan><tspan dy="-5">u</tspan><tspan dy="5" font-size="13">2</tspan></text>
        <text class="f-label f-t-amber" x={CX} y="262" text-anchor="middle">σ₁ = σ<tspan dy="5" font-size="13">max</tspan><tspan dy="-5"> = {f2(s1)}</tspan></text>
        <text class="f-label f-t-green" x={CX} y="284" text-anchor="middle">σ₂ = σ<tspan dy="5" font-size="13">min</tspan><tspan dy="-5"> = {f2(s2)}</tspan></text>
      </g>

      <g transform={`translate(${v.o[2][0]} ${v.o[2][1]})`}>
        <text class="f-title" x={CX} y="24" text-anchor="middle">{ru ? 'после Ŵ = W / σ' : 'after Ŵ = W / σ'}<tspan dy="5" font-size="13">max</tspan></text>
        <line class="f-grid" x1={CX - R} x2={CX + R} y1={CY} y2={CY} />
        <line class="f-grid" x1={CX} x2={CX} y1={CY - R} y2={CY + R} />
        <path class="f-thin f-muted f-dash" d={unitPath} />
        <path class="f-fill-blue" d={wnPath} />
        <path class="f-line f-blue" d={wnPath} />
        <line class="f-line f-amber f-bold" x1={CX} y1={CY} x2={px(u1)} y2={py(u1)} />
        <circle cx={px(u1)} cy={py(u1)} r="3.5" fill="var(--fig-amber)" />
        <circle cx={px(u1, -1)} cy={py(u1, -1)} r="3.5" fill="var(--fig-amber)" />
        <text class="f-math f-t-amber f-halo" x={px(u1, 1.32)} y={py(u1, 1.32) + 6} text-anchor="middle">u<tspan dy="5" font-size="13">1</tspan></text>
        <text class="f-small f-t-muted f-halo" x={px(u1, -1) - 6} y={py(u1, -1) + 30} text-anchor="middle">{ru ? "касание в ±u₁" : "touches at ±u₁"}</text>
        <path class="f-thin f-muted" d={`M ${px(u1, -1) - 4} ${py(u1, -1) + 18} L ${px(u1, -1) - 1} ${py(u1, -1) + 7}`} marker-end="url(#f-arrow-muted)" />
        <text class="f-label f-t-amber" x={CX} y="262" text-anchor="middle">{ru ? "наибольшая полуось = 1" : "longest semi-axis = 1"}</text>
        <text class="f-label" x={CX} y="284" text-anchor="middle">‖Ŵh‖₂ ≤ ‖h‖₂</text>
      </g>

      {!v.narrow && (
        <g>
          <line class="f-line" x1={PW + 4} x2={PW + GAP - 4} y1={CY} y2={CY} marker-end="url(#f-arrow)" />
          <text class="f-math f-halo" x={PW + GAP / 2} y={CY - 12} text-anchor="middle">W</text>
          <line class="f-line" x1={2 * PW + GAP + 4} x2={2 * PW + 2 * GAP - 4} y1={CY} y2={CY} marker-end="url(#f-arrow)" />
          <text class="f-math f-halo" x={2 * PW + 1.5 * GAP} y={CY - 12} text-anchor="middle">÷σ₁</text>
        </g>
      )}
      {v.narrow && (
        <g>
          <line class="f-line" x1={NX + CX} x2={NX + CX} y1="226" y2="290" marker-end="url(#f-arrow)" />
          <text class="f-label" x={NX + CX + 14} y="264">{ru ? "умножение на W" : "multiply by W"}</text>
          <line class="f-line" x1={NX + CX} x2={NX + CX} y1="600" y2="680" marker-end="url(#f-arrow)" />
          <text class="f-label" x={NX + CX + 14} y="646">{ru ? 'деление на σ' : 'divide by σ'}<tspan dy="5" font-size="13">max</tspan></text>
        </g>
      )}
    </svg>
  ))}
</Figure>
